  - KI5GeneralFixes/         the mod itself, all Lua, scripts and assets
                             authored for it
  - tests/                   the headless test harness and its specs
  - tools/                   asset generators
  - README.md, NOTICE        and other project documentation


THIRD PARTY WORK

This project patches other Project Zomboid mods. Those mods remain the property
of their respective authors. The All Rights Reserved grant above does not extend
to them, and nothing here claims rights over them.

No files or code from any of them are incorporated. Every fix is written from
scratch against the behaviour those mods exhibit, which is a description of what
they do rather than a copy of how they do it. The mods concerned are named in
NOTICE, with what was read and what was not taken.

Should that ever change, the incorporated work will be listed in NOTICE before it
ships, with the terms it ships under. Where a source mod states terms, those
terms govern. Where a source mod states no terms, no permission has been granted
by its author and the incorporation rests on nothing more than the absence of an
objection.

The unpacked source of the mods this one patches is kept locally, under
other-mods/, so the fixes can be written against what the game actually loads. It
is excluded from this repository and from the Workshop upload. It is not
redistributed in any form.


BASE GAME

Project Zomboid is the property of The Indie Stone. This project is an
unofficial modification, is not affiliated with or endorsed by The Indie Stone,
and is subject to their terms for user created content. Portions of this
project interoperate with, and follow the behaviour of, the base game's own
code and data.


CONTACT

For permission requests, or for any author who wishes their work removed from
this project, contact aspctt. Removal requests will be honoured.
